{"seq":2,"slug":"early-stopping-scheduling","title":"早停与调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/early-stopping-scheduling","wordCount":1535,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"早停与调度策略\">早停与调度策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>早停剪枝</strong>：检测&quot;注定失败&quot;的配置并提前终止，释放资源给更有希望的 trial</li>\n<li><strong>调度器层级</strong>：Median/Percentile（统计比较）→ Hyperband/ASHA（多保真度淘汰）→ PBT（动态超参数轨迹）</li>\n<li><strong>学习曲线预测</strong>：参数化曲线拟合或 Transformer 序列模型，在少量 epoch 后预测最终排名</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要早停\">为什么需要早停</h2><p>深度学习中一次超参数评估可能耗时数小时。如果一个配置在第 5 个 epoch 的验证损失已经远落后于当前最优配置在第 5 个 epoch 的表现，继续训练到 200 epoch 几乎不可能逆转——这是白白浪费的计算。早停（early stopping）机制检测这种&quot;注定失败&quot;的配置并提前终止，将节省的资源重新分配给更有希望的配置。</p>\n<p>早停与<a href=\"../algorithms/multi-fidelity-methods\">多保真度方法</a>的区别：多保真度方法在优化循环层面做&quot;先低后高&quot;的预算分配；早停是在单次 trial 执行层面做&quot;是否继续&quot;的决策。两者可以叠加使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中位数剪枝\">中位数剪枝</h2><p>Optuna 的 <code>MedianPruner</code> 是最直接的策略：在每个 epoch（或报告间隔）检查当前 trial 的中间结果，如果它在同一 epoch 处的性能低于所有已完成 trial 的中位数，则剪枝终止。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Prune if: </mtext><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(最小化场景)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Prune if: } v_t^{(i)} &gt; \\text{median}(v_t^{(1)}, v_t^{(2)}, \\dots, v_t^{(k)}) \\quad \\text{(最小化场景)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2906em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Prune if: </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2948em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最小化场景</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>n_startup_trials</code></td>\n<td>前 N 个 trial 不剪枝（积累基线）</td>\n<td>5–10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n_warmup_steps</code></td>\n<td>每个 trial 前 M 步不剪枝</td>\n<td>10–20% 总 epoch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>interval_steps</code></td>\n<td>每隔几步检查一次</td>\n<td>1–5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n_min_trials</code></td>\n<td>至少有 K 个完成 trial 才开始比较</td>\n<td>3–5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import optuna&#10;&#10;pruner = optuna.pruners.MedianPruner(&#10;    n_startup_trials=5,&#10;    n_warmup_steps=10,&#10;    interval_steps=1&#10;)&#10;&#10;study = optuna.create_study(pruner=pruner)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pruner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.pruners.MedianPruner(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_startup_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_warmup_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    interval_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.create_study(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pruner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pruner)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>中位数剪枝的风险：正则化较强的配置（如高 dropout、高 weight decay）在前期表现可能较差但最终更好。<code>n_warmup_steps</code> 的设置需要平衡&quot;尽早节约&quot;和&quot;避免错杀&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"percentile-与-threshold-剪枝\">Percentile 与 Threshold 剪枝</h2><p><strong>Percentile Pruner</strong>：更激进的变体——如果当前 trial 低于已完成 trial 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 百分位（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>），则剪枝。适合评估预算充裕且希望快速筛选的场景。</p>\n<p><strong>Threshold Pruner</strong>：设置绝对性能阈值——如果验证损失超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，立即终止。适合有明确&quot;不可接受&quot;标准的场景（如 NLP 任务中 perplexity 超过 100 就没有继续的价值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hyperband-pruner\">Hyperband Pruner</h2><p>Optuna 将 Hyperband 封装为 <code>HyperbandPruner</code>，在内部管理多个 bracket 的 Successive Halving：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"pruner = optuna.pruners.HyperbandPruner(&#10;    min_resource=1,        # 最低保真度（epoch）&#10;    max_resource=81,       # 最高保真度&#10;    reduction_factor=3     # eta: 每轮淘汰 2/3&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pruner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.pruners.HyperbandPruner(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    min_resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最低保真度（epoch）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">81</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最高保真度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reduction_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # eta: 每轮淘汰 2/3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与独立的 Hyperband 调度器不同，Optuna 的 HyperbandPruner 与 TPE Sampler 协同工作——TPE 负责&quot;选什么配置&quot;，HyperbandPruner 负责&quot;训练多少 epoch&quot;。这实质上实现了 BOHB 的效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于学习曲线的自适应早停\">基于学习曲线的自适应早停</h2><p>比统计剪枝更精细的方法是预测学习曲线的走向：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[收集前 k 个 epoch 的验证损失] --&gt; B[拟合参数曲线模型]&#10;    B --&gt; C{预测最终性能&lt;br/&gt;优于当前 top-q?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[继续训练]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[剪枝终止]&#10;    C --&gt;|不确定| F[再训练几个 epoch 后重新判断]\">graph LR\n    A[收集前 k 个 epoch 的验证损失] --&gt; B[拟合参数曲线模型]\n    B --&gt; C{预测最终性能&lt;br/&gt;优于当前 top-q?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[继续训练]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[剪枝终止]\n    C --&gt;|不确定| F[再训练几个 epoch 后重新判断]</pre><p>曲线模型的选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>幂律衰减：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t) = a \\cdot t^{-\\alpha} + c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8547em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>指数衰减：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t) = a \\cdot e^{-\\alpha t} + c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8769em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>贝叶斯模型平均：对多个参数曲线族加权组合</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Optuna 的 <code>WilcoxonPruner</code>（v4.x 新增）使用 Wilcoxon 符号秩检验对比当前 trial 与已完成 trial 的中间结果序列，提供比简单中位数比较更稳健的统计判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"patience-based-早停\">Patience-based 早停</h2><p>不与其他 trial 比较，而是监控自身改进趋势：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Stop if: </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>δ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>连续 </mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext> 步无改进</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Stop if: } v_t - v_{t-p} &lt; \\delta \\quad \\text{连续 } p \\text{ 步无改进}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Stop if: </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">连续</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">步无改进</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是 Keras <code>EarlyStopping</code> 回调和 PyTorch Lightning 中常用的策略。它解决的是&quot;单个 trial 是否已收敛&quot;的问题，与优化器级别的剪枝互补。</p>\n<p><strong>结合 HPO 剪枝与模型早停</strong>：在 Optuna trial 内同时使用 patience-based 早停（检测收敛）和 Optuna pruner（检测劣势）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def objective(trial):&#10;    model = build_model(trial)&#10;    best_val_loss = float(&#39;inf&#39;)&#10;    patience_counter = 0&#10;&#10;    for epoch in range(max_epochs):&#10;        train_loss = train_one_epoch(model)&#10;        val_loss = validate(model)&#10;&#10;        # Optuna pruner: 与其他 trial 比较&#10;        trial.report(val_loss, epoch)&#10;        if trial.should_prune():&#10;            raise optuna.TrialPruned()&#10;&#10;        # Patience: 检测自身收敛&#10;        if val_loss &lt; best_val_loss - min_delta:&#10;            best_val_loss = val_loss&#10;            patience_counter = 0&#10;        else:&#10;            patience_counter += 1&#10;            if patience_counter &gt;= patience:&#10;                break&#10;&#10;    return best_val_loss\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> objective</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trial):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> build_model(trial)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best_val_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    patience_counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_epochs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        train_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_one_epoch(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        val_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> validate(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # Optuna pruner: 与其他 trial 比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trial.report(val_loss, epoch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.should_prune():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.TrialPruned()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # Patience: 检测自身收敛</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_val_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_delta:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            best_val_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val_loss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            patience_counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            patience_counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> patience_counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> patience:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_val_loss</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"调度策略-预算分配的全局视角\">调度策略：预算分配的全局视角</h2><p>早停是&quot;自底向上&quot;的决策（每个 trial 独立判断是否继续）。调度策略是&quot;自顶向下&quot;的决策（全局视角分配预算给不同 trial）。</p>\n<p><strong>ASHA 调度</strong>：异步 Successive Halving——每个 trial 到达预定的 rung（检查点）时，异步决定是否晋升到下一个保真度级别。不需要等待同一 rung 的所有 trial 完成。在 Ray Tune 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ray.tune.schedulers import ASHAScheduler&#10;&#10;scheduler = ASHAScheduler(&#10;    max_t=100,           # 最大 epoch&#10;    grace_period=10,     # 最早可剪枝的 epoch&#10;    reduction_factor=3,  # 每轮保留 1/3&#10;    brackets=1           # bracket 数量&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ray.tune.schedulers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ASHAScheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ASHAScheduler(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最大 epoch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    grace_period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最早可剪枝的 epoch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reduction_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每轮保留 1/3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    brackets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # bracket 数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Population Based Training (PBT)</strong>：不是早停或淘汰，而是在训练过程中动态修改超参数。底部 25% 的 trial 复制顶部 25% 的模型权重和超参数，然后对超参数施加随机扰动继续训练。PBT 发现的是超参数<strong>调度</strong>（随训练进度变化的参数轨迹），而非单一固定配置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>决策粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Median Pruner</td>\n<td>每个报告间隔</td>\n<td>快速过滤明显差配置</td>\n<td>单一最优配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hyperband/ASHA</td>\n<td>Rung 级别</td>\n<td>大规模多保真度搜索</td>\n<td>单一最优配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PBT</td>\n<td>每个 perturbation interval</td>\n<td>长训练 + 调度优化</td>\n<td>超参数调度轨迹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Patience EarlyStopping</td>\n<td>每个 epoch</td>\n<td>trial 内收敛检测</td>\n<td>最佳 epoch 数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"早停对代理模型的影响\">早停对代理模型的影响</h2><p>被剪枝的 trial 产生的是不完整观测——它们的目标值不反映&quot;完整训练后的真实性能&quot;。这对代理模型带来挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>偏差</strong>：被剪枝的 trial 通常是差配置，其低保真度结果不应与完整训练的结果直接比较</li>\n<li><strong>方案 1</strong>：只用完整训练的 trial 拟合 GP（忽略剪枝 trial）——浪费信息</li>\n<li><strong>方案 2</strong>：对剪枝 trial 使用&quot;输注值&quot;——如设其目标为最差完整 trial 的值</li>\n<li><strong>方案 3</strong>：建模保真度维度——将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, b, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 三元组全部用于多保真度 GP</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Optuna 默认采用方案 2 的变体（对 pruned trial 的值做特殊处理），<a href=\"search-space-design\">搜索空间设计</a>中讨论的分阶段优化也可缓解此问题——先粗搜收集信息，再精搜时只用完整 trial。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>早停与调度策略从&quot;单次 trial 是否继续&quot;到&quot;全局预算如何分配&quot;提供了多层次的资源优化手段。Median Pruner 简单有效适合快速过滤；Hyperband/ASHA 在多保真度场景下系统性地淘汰差配置；PBT 发现的是超参数随时间变化的最优轨迹。被剪枝 trial 对代理模型带来的偏差需要通过特殊处理或分阶段策略缓解。在 Optuna 和 Ray Tune 中，Sampler 和 Pruner/Scheduler 的正交组合提供了灵活的混搭能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"早停与调度策略","id":"早停与调度策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要早停","id":"为什么需要早停"},{"level":2,"text":"中位数剪枝","id":"中位数剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"Percentile 与 Threshold 剪枝","id":"percentile-与-threshold-剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"Hyperband Pruner","id":"hyperband-pruner"},{"level":2,"text":"基于学习曲线的自适应早停","id":"基于学习曲线的自适应早停"},{"level":2,"text":"Patience-based 早停","id":"patience-based-早停"},{"level":2,"text":"调度策略：预算分配的全局视角","id":"调度策略-预算分配的全局视角"},{"level":2,"text":"早停对代理模型的影响","id":"早停对代理模型的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索空间设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/search-space-design"},"next":{"title":"分布式并行搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/distributed-parallel-search"}}